<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- SCRIPT-DRILLDOWN OFF-PARITY MATRIX (spec D2 / invariant I1).
     IDENTICAL commands to test-cases.xml, but run against config.off.json
     (the script_drilldown block is ABSENT). Every case must yield TODAY's
     decision: the untrusted -File path classifies as `unknown command` => ask;
     only trusted.ps1 allows (via trusted_programs basename matching, which
     predates this feature).

     Ground truth captured 2026-09-20 via debug/_probe_off.ps1 (Invoke-Classify
     under config.off.json with -Cwd = fixture dir). This file must PASS both in
     the RED phase (feature absent) and after implementation (feature present but
     disabled => byte-identical behavior). -->
